<rdf:Description rdf:about='uuid:9618ca91-c9cb-4c28-8e83-25d9c841fc9a' xmlns:dc='http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/' dc:format='application/pdf'><dc:title><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang='x-default'>Evidence-based review of the current guidance on first aid measures for suspension trauma</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></dc:title><dc:description><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang='x-default'>The report quoted and summarised advice extracted from various papers concerning harness suspension and noted that, &apos;some of the advice appears to conflict&apos;.</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></dc:description><dc:creator><rdf:Seq><rdf:li>HSE</rdf:li></rdf:Seq></dc:creator></rdf:Description>
